Net effect when --sequential_pair_promotion_model_active_promote is omitted (default):
active_promotion_feature_builder stays None, the new closure block is a no-op,
PromotionShadowJsonlSession(active_promote=False) reproduces the exact old JSONL log
fields -- verified via a synthetic session smoke test (see PHASE3_IMPLEMENTATION.md).
